sequenceDiagram
  participant API as Assessment API
  participant DB as oj_assessment task store
  participant W1 as Worker A
  participant W2 as Worker B
  API->>DB: transaction creates PENDING task and outbox
  W1->>DB: conditional claim at generation n for leaseOwner A
  Note over W1,DB: lease expires or Worker A crashes
  W2->>DB: conditional re-claim at next generation for leaseOwner B
  W1->>DB: conditional final write checks task, generation, owner, live lease
  DB-->>W1: zero rows, stale sandbox output is fenced and discarded
  W2->>DB: fenced final write for current generation
  DB-->>W2: one terminal result and versioned outbox event
